<title>QATAR: Qatar National Bank lifts 1996 profits 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Qatar National Bank lifts 1996 profits 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatar National Bank said on Monday it posted a record profit of 329.7 million riyals in 1996, up 14 percent from the 289 million riyal profit in 1995.</p>
<p>In a statement it said the board had proposed the payment of a cash dividend equal to 25 percent of the capital and the issue of bonus shares on the basis of one for every four held.</p>
</text>
